        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Bui khang zaengsini cho ringhmei chaeng tatmei khang",
            "Rianra mei pat louna Ravguangc khou bam kan the,",
            "Neihla na zaeng nthaek kan the,",
            "Jisu daeng khou lung chamh dat khang.",
            "",
            "2. Tat du kan the kandi rianra mei patlou na,",
            "Su-nuh naonian mei guai ganlou na tatkan the,",
            "Tingkao kandi ramgai khoutei",
            "Khrista Jisu le lung datni.",
            "",
            "3. Chunsina bam ri o, zaeng sina bam ri o,",
            "Kandi rianra heizu gan louna tat kan the;",
            "Kapma huai bammei tei ruina,",
            "Ngalan guang dat pukhang hamh the.",
            "",
            "4. Chunsi zaengsi mei mak, mikdui ni keidat mak,",
            "Hei ram khou tei aniu meiguai ni ku puni;",
            "Hei kandi hei ganlou pukhou,",
            "Aniu meiguai ni tat puni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
